          "snippet": {
            "line": 394,
            "text": "theorem physicalAlias_eq_cutoff_derivative {a d b M : ℝ} (ha : 0 < a)\n    (v : E) (g : ℝ × E → V) (z : ℝ × E) (hz : a / 2 < z.1) :\n    physicalAlias d a b M v g z = deriv (physicalCutoff d a b) z.1 •\n      TransportPrimitive.totalIntegral M v (normalizeSource d a g) (liftChart (powerChart d a) z)"
